{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"liyue_millelith","name_zh":"千岩军与总务司","name_en":"Millelith and Civil Affairs","aliases":["千岩军与总务司","Millelith and Civil Affairs","千岩军","Millelith","总务司","璃月总务司","Ministry of Civil Affairs"],"category":"organization","scope":"regional","regions":["Liyue"],"summary":"千岩军与总务司均受璃月七星领导：千岩军是驻守璃月、承担巡逻、警戒和打击犯罪等任务的军事力量；总务司是总部设于璃月港的政府组织，管理资源、公共安全、港务、商业、税务、节庆及其他民政事务，并会因公共安全需要调遣千岩军。证据仅支持这种协作和调遣关系，不足以认定千岩军日常隶属于总务司。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"liyue_millelith_fact_01","text":"千岩军是驻扎于璃月各地、向璃月七星汇报的军事力量，承担守卫职责。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"证据所述现状","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_millelith","fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_02"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_millelith_fact_02","text":"千岩军除巡逻璃月各地外，也会秘密渗透犯罪团体，以削弱或逮捕相关人员。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"证据所述现状","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_millelith","fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_02"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_millelith_fact_03","text":"总务司是璃月七星下属的政府组织，总部位于璃月港，由多个部门组成，并会在保障公共安全时调遣千岩军。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"证据所述现状","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_01"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_millelith_fact_04","text":"总务司管理的资源包括物资、人力和情报，并通过这些资源的流通与调配处理事务。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"证据所述现状","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_01","local_sup_liyue_millelith_01"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_millelith_fact_05","text":"总务司的职责范围包括公共安全、节庆管理、海事与港口行政、商业许可与监管、进出口手续、劳动与税务行政、邮件转递和纠纷调解。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"证据所述现状","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_01"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_millelith_fact_06","text":"总务司会封锁危险区域、发布通缉悬赏，并维护针对潜在危险人物或组织的不同等级观察名单，其中部分名单属于最高机密。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"证据所述现状","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_01"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_millelith_fact_07","text":"在绯云坡水源污染事件中，总务司公告由专业人员处理污染，千岩军则提示替代取水地点，并负责受理对破坏秩序或污染水源者的报告和执行惩处。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"绯云坡水源污染事件期间","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_liyue_millelith_03"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_millelith_fact_08","text":"总务司曾因事故封闭层岩巨渊矿区、要求停止作业并实施许可管制；其职员和千岩军人员较容易取得相关通行许可，总务司也向当地派驻了专员。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"证据所述层岩巨渊关闭期间","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_01","local_sup_liyue_millelith_04"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_millelith_fact_09","text":"千岩军对新兵实行标准化训练和严格考核，重视士兵的警觉、纪律、集体阵形与大规模战术，并可根据地形将部队拆分为较小阵形。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"证据所述现状","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_millelith","fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_02"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"Archon War 时期","order_hint":10,"events":["千岩军的前身为 Millelith Brigade，并曾参与 Archon War。"],"current_status":"该形态属于千岩军的早期组织历史。","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_millelith","fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_02"]},{"period":"Archon War 结束后","order_hint":20,"events":["千岩军开始向璃月七星汇报。"],"current_status":"证据所述现状中，千岩军仍向璃月七星汇报。","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_millelith","fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_02"]},{"period":"Cataclysm 时期","order_hint":30,"events":["许多千岩军士兵在层岩巨渊与 Bosacius 并肩对抗 Abyss，并为此牺牲。"],"current_status":"该事件构成千岩军的历史战损记录。","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_millelith","fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_02"]},{"period":"层岩巨渊事故后","order_hint":40,"events":["总务司封闭层岩巨渊矿区、停止相关作业并实行许可管制，同时向当地派驻专员。"],"current_status":"证据所述时期，层岩巨渊处于关闭和许可管制状态；证据未给出后续解除日期。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_01","local_sup_liyue_millelith_04"]},{"period":"与 Beisht 的战斗之后","order_hint":50,"events":["为应对未来同等规模的袭击，璃月七星重组了千岩军的指挥体系，并设立汇集军事顾问、整合情报和协调行动的参谋部门。","千岩军引入了以假设情景综合测试士兵集结和指挥能力的训练方式。"],"current_status":"相关重组和训练制度构成千岩军后续军制发展的组成部分。","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_millelith","fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_02"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"璃月民众通常可以知道千岩军负责巡逻、守卫和执法，也能通过公告、许可及公共事务接触总务司；总务司的秘密情报、观察名单和千岩军的秘密渗透行动则不属于一般公开信息。","likely_known_by":["璃月七星及其工作人员","总务司职员","千岩军人员","璃月港居民与商人","需要办理许可、税务、港务或通行事务者"],"unlikely_known_by":["不了解璃月行政体系的外地普通访客","无相关权限的一般居民","与治安、情报或层岩巨渊事务无关者"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":[]},"activation_keys":["千岩军与总务司","Millelith and Civil Affairs","千岩军","Millelith","总务司","璃月总务司","Ministry of Civil Affairs"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["千岩军在特定任务中可作为敌人遭遇的游戏呈现。","版本号、页面变更历史、Wiki 分类计数及角色列表等检索或页面信息。"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["古代千岩军具有超常力量的说法在来源中带有推测性质，本卡未将其确认为事实。","总务司建筑内图书馆是否对外开放以及其具体用途均属未知。","没有将词条标题中的名称并列解释为千岩军日常隶属于总务司。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_liyue_millelith","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Millelith","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Millelith","language":"en","revision_id":"2039672","source_text_sha256":"e5e926547367c0cac95d3435539e61964875fcff9bfc610f12125e0d30d32407"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Ministry of Civil Affairs","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ministry_of_Civil_Affairs","language":"en","revision_id":"2050633","source_text_sha256":"fe700a2bbda28d71ef538f94a7c1604771a639245d2c8bf211bef363cfb1be09"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_liyue_millelith_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Millelith","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Millelith","language":"en","revision_id":"2039672","source_text_sha256":"bdb26dec1fcddb7ef1c2ce67658c3be12246c1aed5eafc018d225e4012825c7f"},{"source_id":"local_sup_liyue_millelith_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"「总务司」的事务","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_71650.json#unit=7165001","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"0eab37076800f0dc273da06d6d473f4d679a3780d1d695f436231e6ab9799bd6"},{"source_id":"local_sup_liyue_millelith_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"本地游戏对话 6986003","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Storyboard/Storyboard_6986003.json#unit=6986003","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"5e86fcbb2b6d797ebbb4eccc9d06ceac73eaa6f7b822090f1e5036ea9f928a98"},{"source_id":"local_sup_liyue_millelith_03","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"本地游戏对话 50401","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Npc/Npc_50401.json#unit=50401","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"d3dc792604848bbcfaee109bb45b0c7279de32e1dc5db84ab68a299aa5af1814"},{"source_id":"local_sup_liyue_millelith_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"本地游戏对话 7104801","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Npc/Npc_7104801.json#unit=7104801","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"3a074e34463620e31a077b7976f442619177a6b035fb0c182ffcae74f879fdd5"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"06a3a211331d3a2b856fce940a8f1498656d23ffad30f7298fac38d33f699391","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["证据仅表明总务司有时会为公共安全调遣千岩军，不能据此确定千岩军日常隶属于总务司。","层岩巨渊的关闭与许可管制状态仅能确定于证据文本所述时期，后续是否以及何时解除没有得到说明。","古代千岩军具有超常力量的描述带有推测性质，未纳入已确认事实。"],"missing_evidence":[],"needs_human_review":false}}